{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1653161,\"title\":\"The Old Man\",\"tagline\":\"A long-serving official can only retire after fully fulfilling his duties as a father!\",\"overview\":\"When a lonely widower realizes his grown children have phased him out of their lives, he stages an elaborate deception to lure them back to their childhood home, forcing a confrontation with the family's fractured past.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rpO7N32jinsDWU5o2rpS3xIc1iv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zfPqYIRWCZnKDXCkbqvAtwQPmYR.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2026,\"runtime\":100,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"KH\",\"name\":\"Cambodia\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Somchanrith Chap\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":3199059,\"name\":\"Somchanrith Chap\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s9fm4VkPbw2QhbydwWchU94sUmi.jpg\"},{\"id\":6077090,\"name\":\"Taing Meng\",\"character\":\"Sun\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1285957,\"name\":\"Tep Rindaro\",\"character\":\"Ta Ro\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mwXm2wDLGQznHfpb2oOlDJtrDEq.jpg\"},{\"id\":5462880,\"name\":\"Bun Kaven\",\"character\":\"Rith\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6077092,\"name\":\"Hailey Pheng\",\"character\":\"Reach\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6077093,\"name\":\"Bella Danith\",\"character\":\"Reaksmey\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":150540,\"title\":\"Inside Out\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2H1TmgdfNtsKlU9jKdeNyYL5y8T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jJKZaTBNenlFclQyjrnvzkRmvWE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When 11-year-old Riley moves to a new city, her Emotions team up to help her through the transition. Joy, Fear, Anger, Disgust and Sadness work together, but when Joy and Sadness get lost, they must journey through unfamiliar places to get back home.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":508943,\"title\":\"Luca\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9x4i9uKGXt8IiiIF5Ey0DIoY738.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/620hnMVLu6RSZW6a5rwO8gqpt0t.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Luca and his best friend Alberto experience an unforgettable summer on the Italian Riviera. But all the fun is threatened by a deeply-held secret: they are sea monsters from another world just below the water’s surface.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":51052,\"title\":\"Arthur Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/brELZkSbkLrcCXJ0xt5hQUMXhut.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hwtYE4Gs0IsBnrJ0nTZItOXlz19.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"For hundreds of years, the Claus family has delegated the title \\\"Santa\\\" to a chosen few of its members, which can be passed down upon retirement. Each Christmas, Santa and his vast army of highly trained elves produce gifts and distribute them around the world in a one-night high-tech operation. However, when one of 600 million children to receive a gift from Santa on Christmas Eve is missed, it is deemed ‘acceptable’ to all but one—Arthur Claus, the current Santa’s misfit son deemed ineligible for the title, who executes an unauthorised rookie mission to get the last present halfway around the globe before dawn on Christmas morning.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Animation\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11130,\"title\":\"The Princess Diaries 2: Royal Engagement\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/upJOyrxxSIxlSZC7KEqJfB1vlGl.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pmOXaAK8hteMlCiMZyyDJENHCZI.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mia Thermopolis is now a college graduate and on her way to Genovia to take up her duties as princess. Accompanied by her friend Lilly, Mia continues her 'princess lessons', like riding horses side-saddle and archery. But her already complicated life is turned upside down once again when she learns that she is to take the crown as queen earlier than expected, all while she meets a mysteriously charming young man.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":360814,\"title\":\"Dangal\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cJRPOLEexI7qp2DKtFfCh7YaaUG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l0fNAHLOFReQJsxCOmGWvJDnimn.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Dangal is an extraordinary true story based on the life of Mahavir Singh and his two daughters, Geeta and Babita Phogat. The film traces the inspirational journey of a father who trains his daughters to become world class wrestlers.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":196867,\"title\":\"Annie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aKAM9V0izx4VhsdyAdBvAB26UCZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j3snmrxqxT60FrH1Z8i54fGnHZJ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Annie is a young, happy foster kid who's also tough enough to make her way on the streets of New York in 2014. Originally left by her parents as a baby with the promise that they'd be back for her someday, it's been a hard knock life ever since with her mean foster mom Miss Hannigan. But everything's about to change when the hard-nosed tycoon and New York mayoral candidate Will Stacks—advised by his brilliant VP and his shrewd and scheming campaign advisor—makes a thinly-veiled campaign move and takes her in. Stacks believes he's her guardian angel, but Annie's self-assured nature and bright, sun-will-come-out-tomorrow outlook on life just might mean it's the other way around.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13688,\"title\":\"CJ7\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sRzSfpSb3wYYshbaiMRIuFCJJGU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7y0ol1zsvs0GbYR0BdTvWdOIDHo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A poor construction worker, who struggles to keep his son in private school, mistakes an orb he finds in a junkjard for a toy which proves to be much, much more once the young boy starts to play with it.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":74465,\"title\":\"We Bought a Zoo\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dcOvIqdsojUdAtWt1nPT9xS76Su.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3epmRoQFyUpLATk1JKgnKKQp0kM.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Benjamin has lost his wife and, in a bid to start his life over, purchases a large house that has a zoo – welcome news for his daughter, but his son is not happy about it. The zoo is in need of renovation and Benjamin sets about the work with the head keeper and the rest of the staff, but, the zoo soon runs into financial trouble.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8326,\"title\":\"Holes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o2Dm2mcE1qW8vT0bpsJO5OMBbqa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cVMK2k0Wbs8DV3IK5sS4ziVenrI.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After being wrongfully convicted for stealing a pair of shoes, Stanley Yelnats is sent away to Camp Green Lake, a boys detention facility where inmates are forced to dig holes all day in the hot desert sun as a form of character building. As he endures the brutal routine, Stanley begins to uncover a hidden truth behind the camp, one that connects to a dangerous secret—and possibly Stanley’s family itself.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10735,\"title\":\"What a Girl Wants\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gGpMruX59KWNuAXgHpiAm8hiChw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bZwUUgz0pgl1cEjcvpDSsBfYvzK.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"American Daphne Reynolds heads to Europe in search of the father she's never met. But instead of finding a British version of her boho mother, she learns the love of her mom's life is an uptight politician. The only problem now is that her long-lost father is engaged to a fiercely territorial social climber with a daughter who makes Daphne's life miserable.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":539745,\"title\":\"Animal Farm\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6pzI1DIlxwAFffw9OZcG6cr031U.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/msl0OTRGavjjzzPZmNuXbC0gv9M.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A group of farm animals rise up against their neglectful owner, dreaming of equality and freedom. But as the pigs take control, the revolution turns into tyranny, with truth rewritten and dissent crushed.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":305145,\"title\":\"Samurai Chicks\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j27LVsqSQKBEj3X5FXN96ekpk2i.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On of the southernmost islands of Japan, there's a dance school 'Orion Dancers Academy'. Hiding its public identity as a training school of singers and dancers, it actually operates as a girl-warrior training school, in order to win independence of the island. The secretly trained agents watch the music video of charismatic idol Cocoe on a huge TV monitor, and unlock codes from her dancing to complete their missions. However, the dark shadow of a rival organization slowly sneaks up on the girls and the training school on the island.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"6o8v6U3HofM\",\"name\":\"Official trailer [ ចាស់កំព្រា | The Old Man ]\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}